<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian</p>
<p>soccer championship matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p> Bahia	     1    Botafogo		2</p>
<p> Bragantino	1    Vasco da Gama	 2</p>
<p> Cricuma	   4    Fluminense	    1</p>
<p> Cruzeiro	  2    Flamengo		1</p>
<p> Goias	     0    Palmeiras	     0</p>
<p> Gremio	    2    Vitoria		 2</p>
<p> Juventude	 2    Internacional	 1</p>
<p> Parana	    3    Guarani		 0</p>
<p> Portuguesa	3    Atletico Mineiro    1</p>
<p> Sao Paulo	 2    Santos		  1</p>
<p> Sport Recife    3    Coritiba		0</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Sao Paulo		   4  3  1  0 10  5 10</p>
<p> Juventude		   5  3  1  1  5  4 10</p>
<p> Portuguesa		  4  3  0  1  8  3  9</p>
